{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The English version is scheduled to be updated progressively for free.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please look forward to the completion of the translation from the Japanese version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ortho Blaze is a completely new RPG that inherited the spirit of our circle game ``Blaze of the Orthos''.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an alternative action battle and narrative RPG that revolves around an ancient genie legend and the thoughts of many characters intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The appeal is the carefully planned scenario, the 2D dotted world, and the exhilarating feeling of defeating enemies with dynamic techniques in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/65ffa5dd77c6c652830981320df08478.avif?t=1755536460\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras_big/65ffa5dd77c6c652830981320df08478.avif?t=1755536460 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your battle skills and take advantage of each character's strengths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/d1f04622696dbf8c25c2ca022429f346.poster.avif?t=1755536460\" width=170 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/d1f04622696dbf8c25c2ca022429f346.webm?t=1755536460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658550/extras/d1f04622696dbf8c25c2ca022429f346.mp4?t=1755536460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p cl